ois's own estate.","confidence":"low","open_questions":["Fractions come from a commercial guide; verify against the Civil Code.","Text of Trusts Act 2021 forced-heirship provision not read; official page blocked.","Foundations Act 2009 text not verified.","Hague Trusts Convention: The HCCH status table (checked 2026-10-16) lists 14 Contracting Parties; this country is not one of them and no UK, Dutch or Chinese extension covers it, so the 1985 Convention is not in force here."],"sources":[{"title":"Trusts Act, 2021 (Act 34 of 2021)","url":"https://seylii.org/akn/sc/act/2021/34","publisher":"SeyLII","kind":"legislation","accessed":"2026-10-16"},{"title":"Durup & Ors v Brassel & Anor [2013] SCCC 6","url":"https://old.seylii.org/sc/judgment/constitutional-court/2013/6-1","publisher":"SeyLII","kind":"other","accessed":"2026-10-16"},{"title":"Inheritance tax and inheritance law in Seychelles","url":"https://www.globalpropertyguide.com/Africa/Seychelles/Inheritance","publisher":"Global Property Guide","kind":"other","accessed":"2026-10-16"},{"title":"Seychelles inheritance and estate tax","url":"https://www.expanship.com/sc/blog/seychelles-inheritance-and-estate-tax","publisher":"Expanship","kind":"other","accessed":"2026-10-16"},{"title":"HCCH status table: Convention of 1 July 1985 on the Law Applicable to Trusts and on their Recognition","url":"https://www.hcch.net/en/instruments/conventions/status-table/?cid=59","publisher":"Hague Conference on Private International Law","kind":"intergovernmental","accessed":"2026-10-16"}]}}